<!--
  Pazapa Adult English | A2
  Week 3 | Lesson 1 | Step 7 | Review, improve and retry
  Activity id: A2-W03-L1-S7

  ============================================================
  SOURCE NOTES (authors and developers)
  ============================================================

  CONTENT KEYS (all in the KEYS object in the script, one place to edit)
    Recall bank (model phrases are hidden until the learner tries or asks):
      W01 L1  "Yesterday I worked until six."
      W02 L3  "This is Amina. She's originally from Tunisia."
      W03 L1  "I have to do a medical test first."
      Recall is never scored. Any equivalent phrase that does the same job is fine.
    Situation scene key ..... "She is asking what she needs to do" (process question).
    Written listening route .. line "You need to bring your passport and two photos."
                               key = passport + photo(s). Labelled as a written recall route,
                               never as a listening result.
    Pronunciation ............ phrase "I have to do a medical test first." Self-comparison only.
                               No accent score. Nothing is analysed.
    Reading recall ........... Q "When is the appointment?"  Key = "Tuesday at ten".
                               Evidence = the displayed practice text, key words highlighted.
                               Accepted: day Tuesday + time ten / 10 / 10:00 in any order.
    Repair ................... draft "I need bring my passport."
                               accepted: "I need to bring my passport." and "I have to bring my passport."
                               (surrounding spaces, case and final punctuation are ignored)
    Communication anchor ..... cue "What do I need to bring?"
                               possible reply "You need to bring your passport and booking message."
                               (an example, never an exact-match answer)
    Transfer ................. NEW fictional case (Nadia, Wednesday at two, ID card + two photos).
                               It is labelled as a new case and does not change the reading text.
                               possible reply "You need to bring your ID card and two photos."
    Open replies are self-checked by the learner. Nothing is ticked automatically.

  OPTIONAL PRIOR ATTEMPT (Step 6)
    If the host page sets  window.PAZAPA_STEP6_ATTEMPT = "text of the learner's Step 6 reply"
    before this file runs, the first-reply box offers a button to use it for comparison.
    If it is not set, nothing is shown and nothing is claimed to be restored.

  MODEL AUDIO (configurable)
    CONFIG.audio.listen and CONFIG.audio.pron take a verified audio file URL.
    Empty = a clear "not available" state and a written route. Audio never autoplays.
    There are no slow-speed buttons.

  OPTIONAL FEEDBACK SERVICE
    None is wired in this file. If a real evaluator is added later: send a selected reply only after
    an explicit learner action, keep credentials on the server, validate the returned data,
    render it as text (textContent), handle pending / failed / unavailable / uncertain results,
    ignore results that arrive after a reply was deleted or replaced, and never invent a score.

  MICROPHONE (optional recording)
    Uses feature detection for getUserMedia and MediaRecorder. Permission is requested only when
    the learner presses Start recording. Tracks are stopped after capture and when leaving a section;
    Blob URLs are released on delete or restart. Audio is kept in memory only (never in localStorage).
    Deployment: serve over HTTPS; when embedded in an iframe the host needs allow="microphone"
    and a compatible Permissions-Policy header.

  COMPLETION
    Done is enabled only on the last section, after: a recall attempt, a checked or repaired point,
    and an improved or supported retry. No microphone, AI result, confidence rating or perfect
    score is required.
    SCORM 1.2 (API) and SCORM 2004 (API_1484_11) are discovered up the window chain.
    completionInFlight / completionSent guard against duplicates. completionSent is set only
    after a confirmed successful commit. A failed commit leaves Done available to retry.
    Confirmed completion is restored when the LMS reports it. With no LMS the activity completes
    locally. CONFIG.parentOrigin can be set to also post a message to the parent page.
    No score is sent and no navigation is forced.

  IMAGES
    All pictures and the logo are taken from the Week 3 Lesson 1 workbook PDF and embedded below.
-->
<style>
:root{
  --blue:#36BBD6; --blue-dark:#1B7E92; --green:#C9D646; --yellow:#FCC104; --red:#E6352B;
  --grey-light:#EBEBEB; --ink:#2E2E2D; --line:#6B6B6A;
  --blue-20:#D7F1F7; --green-20:#F4F7DA; --yellow-20:#FEF3CD; --yellow-40:#FEE69B; --cream:#FFFCF3;
  --hf:"Filson Soft","Open Sans",Arial,sans-serif; --bf:"Open Sans",Arial,sans-serif;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--bf);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.55;touch-action:manipulation;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;color:inherit;touch-action:manipulation}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;margin:-1px;padding:0;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}
.skip{position:absolute;left:8px;top:-70px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;z-index:20;border-radius:6px}
.skip:focus{top:8px}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:2px;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px #fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:var(--hf);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 10px}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.2rem)}
h3{font-size:1.2rem}
h4{font-size:1.05rem}
h2:focus{outline:none}
h2:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:4px}
p{margin:0 0 12px}
.lead{font-size:1.12rem}
.small{font-size:.95rem}
.muted{color:#4a4a49}

/* header + rail */
.top{border-top:8px solid var(--blue);background:#fff;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 24px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px clamp(16px,4vw,48px);border-bottom:2px solid var(--grey-light)}
.brandrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-width:0}
.logo{display:block;width:118px;height:auto;flex:none}
.kicker{margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#4a4a49}
.title{margin:0;font-family:var(--hf);font-weight:800;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.2}
.mode{margin:0;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue-dark)}
.railwrap{background:#fff;border-bottom:2px solid var(--grey-light);padding:10px clamp(16px,4vw,48px)}
.rail{list-style:none;margin:0 auto;padding:0;max-width:1180px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:8px}
.rail button{width:100%;min-height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-align:left;background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px 6px 8px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2}
.rail .n{flex:none;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--grey-light);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:.9rem}
.rail .seen button{background:var(--blue-20);border-color:var(--blue-dark)}
.rail .seen .n{background:var(--blue-dark);color:#fff}
.rail li button[aria-current="step"]{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:#fff}
.rail li button[aria-current="step"] .n{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--ink)}

main{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:26px clamp(16px,4vw,48px) 72px}
.view{display:block}

/* shared pieces */
.btn{min-height:52px;min-width:52px;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:6px;border:3px solid var(--blue-dark);background:var(--blue-dark);color:#fff;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;line-height:1.2}
.btn:hover{background:#166B7C;border-color:#166B7C}
.btn.two{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink)}
.btn.two:hover{background:var(--grey-light)}
.btn.help{background:var(--yellow);border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--ink)}
.btn.help:hover{background:#E8B200}
.btn.small{min-height:48px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:.95rem}
.btn[disabled]{background:var(--grey-light);border-color:#8C8C8B;color:#595958;cursor:not-allowed}
.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:14px 0 0}
label.lbl,.lbl{display:block;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 4px}
input[type=text],textarea{width:100%;min-height:50px;padding:10px 12px;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:#fff}
textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
